Begin3
Title:          xlockmore
Version:        1.11 
Entered-date:   26AUG94 
Description:    Patrick Naughton's xlock + more.  (Actually, image mode was
                taken out (I could put it back in) world is similar though).
                New modes are: spline, maze, sphere, hyper, helix, rock, blot,
                grav, bounce, world, & rect.  Also includes a new option
                -inwindow which allows you to run it in a window. Also
		improvements in portability.
Keywords:       xlock, screen saver, screen lock 
Author:         bagleyd@source.asset.com (David Bagley) 
                and of course Patrick Naughton & others
Maintained-by:  bagleyd@source.asset.com (David Bagley) 
Primary-site:   ftp.x.org /contrib/applications
                83k xlockmore-1.11.tar.gz
                10k xlockmore.README
Alternate-site: sunsite.unc.edu /pub/Linux/X11/xutils/screensavers
                83k xlockmore.1.11.tgz
Original-site:  ftp.x.org /R5contrib
Platform:       SunOS 4.1, Solaris 2.3, Linux, FreeBSD, HP-UX 9.0, AIXV3, VMS.
		Requires X & K&R C although it should compile "right out of
		the box", read the README especially for Solaris2.3.
Copying-policy: BSD
End
